graph TD
    A[数据更新事务<br/>Data Update Transaction] --> B[识别影响范围<br/>Impact Analysis]
    B --> C[构建依赖图<br/>Dependency Graph Construction]
    C --> D[计算失效传播路径<br/>Invalidation Propagation Path]
